+def _reopen_undone(root: Path, w: Any, actor: str | None) -> None:
+    """After an act `w` (a restore or a put-back) rewrote files, open again each kept suggested edit whose words, as its Keep wrote them, stood in a file before the act and stand there no more: the record follows the file back. By the journal's splices, never by reading the text as taken, so an edit the person worked inside since is left kept."""
